kokoro-js adapter
-----------------

src/kokoro-adapter.ts and src/phonemize.ts are adapted and modified from
kokoro-js 1.2.1 source files src/kokoro.js, src/voices.js, and
src/phonemize.js at:

https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro/tree/664c76a704021239ba59c84dcbaa4d3dece01fe9

kokoro-js is authored by hexgrad with contributions by Xenova and is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The adaptations remove streaming and
non-English support, load package-local voice tensors in Node/Bun, use
TypeScript, and integrate directly with @huggingface/transformers 4.2.0.

Kokoro voice tensors
--------------------

The 28 English .bin voice tensors under voices/ are copied from the kokoro-js
1.2.1 npm package. They originate from the Apache-2.0 Kokoro-82M model assets
published by hexgrad/onnx-community.

The Apache License text for these adapted files and assets is provided in
LICENSE-APACHE-2.0. The package's original code remains MIT-licensed under
LICENSE; that MIT license does not replace the terms above. Accordingly, the
package metadata uses the SPDX expression MIT AND Apache-2.0.
